{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#card-zh","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的节点式媒体创作工作室，可在无限画布中组织项目、剧本、分镜表、参考图、图片与视频节点，并将节点连成创作流程。它在 Harness 注册画布面板、对话工具和宿主 API，并提供聊天驱动与手动编辑两种工作方式。主要功能包括编写剧本和多镜头分镜、管理设定集与跨集记忆、生成图片视频及语音、绑定参考素材、编辑节点提示词并预览或导出成片。适合制作短剧、分镜和连续媒体项目。基础画布使用 Harness 已配置的文本模型；图片、视频或语音生成需要用户配置相应模型供应商，演示模式可离线体验。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3602-3615","index.js:4678-4705","index.js:4886-4920","client.js:1-30","docs/guide.en.md:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#card-en","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Infinite Canvas is a node based studio for DeepSeek Harness web. It connects scripts, storyboards, images, and videos on an infinite canvas. Chat tools support drafting, memory, and generation; users can edit nodes directly. It suits short drama production. Text uses Harness models; media generation","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3602-3615","index.js:4678-4705","index.js:4886-4920","client.js:1-30","docs/guide.en.md:1-12"]}
