{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-1","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「节点式创作画布」：在 Web 画布上创建项目，并用文本、剧本、分镜、图片、视频和成片节点组织内容。节点可连接形成创作链，用户可在聊天工具或面板中管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4678-4705","index.js:5384-5410","client.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-2","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「脚本与分镜生成」：通过 Harness 的 LLM 服务生成剧本或分镜文本，再把分镜表与上游剧本及素材节点连接，按节点触发生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3602-3615","index.js:4735-4760","index.js:4886-4920"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-3","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「参考资产和设定集」：项目设定集保存世界观及角色、场景和道具信息，参考素材可绑定到生成节点，辅助跨镜保持设定一致。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5087-5136","index.js:5384-5410","docs/guide.en.md:25-35"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-4","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「分集项目记忆」：聊天工具可读取项目索引或指定画布的完整记忆，也可将每集摘要和正文写回，供后续创作延续剧情状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5144-5200"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-5","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「多模态生成」：用户配置图像、视频或语音模型后，可在图片、视频等节点触发生成；支持编辑提示词并重新生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4886-4920","index.js:4842-4885","docs/guide.en.md:100-130"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-6","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「导演技能包」：按剧本、分镜、提示词或资产创作类型选择透镜、题材、规格和影调切片，将选定创作指导注入文本生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["skill-pack.js:38-100","index.js:5462-5508"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-7","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「右侧栏并排工作」：可在 Harness 右侧栏打开画布标签，与聊天并排查看；不支持该服务时回退到主面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:14-20","client.js:17-20"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#feature-8","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的功能「便携项目数据」：设置数据根目录后，项目文档、资产索引和媒体文件按项目归档，并支持在不同设备之间迁移目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:138-169","index.js:171-200","README.zh-CN.md:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#caveat-1","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的图片、视频与语音生成会调用用户配置的供应商端点；文本生成使用 Harness 已配置的模型服务。选择并配置生成模型前，检查供应商所需的凭据和计费方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3602-3615","client.js:6542-6554","client.js:19183-19313"]}
{"unit_id":"NINKCH__dsh-infinite_canvas#caveat-2","repo":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","commit":"d24020d47e7b74a200069256defae8eb3c397ec1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Infinite Canvas 的项目内容默认保存在浏览器本地存储；配置数据根目录后，项目资料和媒体会写入该目录。外接 ArtCraft 能力需要另行安装可选的 dsh-artcraft。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:21-28","index.js:138-169","package.json:65-73"]}
